## Vendored third-party code

The directory src/v2/vendor/pykep-lambert/ contains source files vendored from
the PyKEP project (https://github.com/esa/pykep), which is licensed under the
Mozilla Public License version 2.0 (MPL-2.0). Those files retain their
upstream MPL-2.0 license. See src/v2/vendor/pykep-lambert/UPSTREAM.md and the
repository NOTICE file for details.

MPL-2.0 is a file-level copyleft license: modifications to the vendored
PyKEP files themselves must remain under MPL-2.0 and source must be made
available, but the rest of Aster v2 remains under MIT.
